      "description": "展开侧栏的当前会话。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"会话\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" aria-current=\"page\">新对话</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{corner-shape:round;width:248px;padding:10px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--glass-surface,rgb(246 249 253 / 72%));box-shadow:var(--glass-shadow,0 3px 12px rgb(31 49 77 / 4%));backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(135%)}.ds-nav-item{corner-shape:var(--corner-shape,superellipse(1.3));width:100%;height:32px;padding:0 8px 0 28px;border:0;border-radius:8px;text-align:left;background:var(--sidebar-accent,#dce6f4);color:var(--sidebar-accent-foreground,#28538d);font:500 13px system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring,#4b7dc4);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
